en a new teacher named Haruko arrives at her school. Soon enough, Medical Mechanica is attacking her town and Hidomi discovers a secret within her that could save everyone, a secret that only Haruko can unlock.\n\nBut why did Haruko return to Earth? \nWhat happened to her Rickenbacker 4001 she left with Naota? \nAnd where did the human-type robot ‘Canti’ go?\n\n\n(Source: Adult Swim)"],"ja":["フリクリ プログレ",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-73471":"2026-02-24T18:59:51Z","movie-119722":"2026-10-14T16:54:41Z","serial-10728":"2020-09-06T18:15:59Z","movie-49972":"2020-02-20T14:20:31Z","serial-16731":"2019-05-16T11:15:53Z","serial-10834":"2018-09-29T17:04:27Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-73471","movie-119722","serial-10728","movie-49972","serial-16731","serial-10834"],"relatedMalIds":[227,35842],"rating":6.33,"relations":[{"id":227,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":35842,"relation":"sequel"}],"availableEpisodeCount":7}]}